{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/application(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey"],"title":"The app","anchor":"The-app"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/device(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey"],"title":"The device","anchor":"The-device"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/operatingSystem(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey"],"title":"The operating system","anchor":"The-operating-system"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/locale(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey"],"title":"The locale","anchor":"The-locale"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/network()","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey"],"title":"The network connection","anchor":"The-network-connection"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/vendorIdentifier()","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey"],"title":"The identifier for vendor","anchor":"The-identifier-for-vendor"}],"metadata":{"title":"StandardContext","modules":[{"name":"StandardContext"}],"externalID":"StandardContext","symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each standard value has an enricher of its own, and nothing is added to a record until the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"builds its tracker with that enricher. Each one sets a typed "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key whose value a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination reads from the record’s context: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app, device, operating system and locale are read once, when the enricher is made, never per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event. The network connection changes while the app runs, so on Apple platforms "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"network()"},{"type":"text","text":" starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NWPathMonitor"},{"type":"text","text":" of its own and sets the latest connection on each record. Give each tracker its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own call. Off Apple platforms there is no device and no path monitor, so those two enrichers set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing, and a server or tool, whose process usually has no Info.plist, passes its own app to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"vendorIdentifier()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", made on the main actor, adds the platform’s identifier for vendor as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value. It is the one identifier here that outlives a session, so add it only when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app has decided to and has the user’s consent. It is never stored or made up: on macOS and Linux,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which have none, records carry no key.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For the session an event was tracked in, use ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import StandardContext","import Trackers","","let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.application(), .operatingSystem(), .locale(), .network()])","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","\/\/ A destination reads each value from the record's context:","\/\/ record.context[ApplicationKey.self]?.version, record.context[OperatingSystemKey.self]?.name"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/sessionsandstandardcontext"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers each value and the identifier for vendor in more detail."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stamp every event with the app, device, operating system, locale and network connection it was tracked on."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/standardcontext"]}],"references":{"doc://StandardContext/documentation/StandardContext/Events/Enricher/vendorIdentifier()":{"url":"\/documentation\/standardcontext\/events\/enricher\/vendoridentifier()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"vendorIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/vendorIdentifier()","title":"vendorIdentifier()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enricher that sets every record’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey"},{"type":"text","text":" to the platform’s identifier for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vendor, where it has one."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://StandardContext/documentation/StandardContext/ApplicationKey":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" key of the app an event was tracked in: its bundle identifier, version and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build, which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.application(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" sets on every record’s context."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey","title":"ApplicationKey","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ApplicationKey","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/standardcontext\/applicationkey","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ApplicationKey","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://StandardContext/documentation/StandardContext/E